  60               
  61                       *"D&177;*"S&177;*"U&177+DRIVE   /GROUP NAME
  62                       *-2                             /GROUP COUNT
  63                       *"D&177;*"S&177;*"U&177+DRIVE   /DEVICE NAME
  64                       *DSDUP&177                      /RELATIVE ENTRY POINT
  65                       *DLENGTH-1                      /LENGTH (HIGHEST BLOCK)
  66                       *REVISION                       /REVISION OF HANDLER
  67                       *"D&177;*"S&177;*"L&177+DRIVE   /DEVICE NAME
  68                       *DSDOWN&177                     /RELATIVE ENTRY POINT
  69                       *DLENGTH-1                      /LENGTH (HIGHEST BLOCK)
  70                       *REVISION                       /REVISION OF HANDLER
